                "retweet_count": 748,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": ".@RobertKennedyJr\u2019s unique leadership on healthy lifestyle choices will benefit countless Americans, and he understands the critical importance of rebuilding trust in our public health institutions. I\u2019ve also received assurances from him that strong pro-life policies will continue to be reinstituted at HHS under his leadership. We spoke extensively about the importance of supporting innovation in health care to both bring down costs and improve treatment. I look forward to working with him to make positive changes for the American people.",
